{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01599",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 5.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.21,
      "end_seconds": 10.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.26,
      "end_seconds": 14.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "I've been feeling hopeless."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.64,
      "end_seconds": 18.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.43,
      "end_seconds": 23.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "It's been going on for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.72,
      "end_seconds": 27.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.31,
      "end_seconds": 46.31,
      "duration_seconds": 17.0,
      "text": "Moderate, really. I've had a plan too, for about four days. I've also had not sleeping for days, since yesterday. About not sleeping for days, pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 60.15,
      "end_seconds": 68.95,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature 36.9, blood pressure 118 over 77, pulse is 79 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.91,
      "end_seconds": 71.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.82,
      "end_seconds": 75.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.78,
      "end_seconds": 78.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.85,
      "end_seconds": 97.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "You are calm but very flat, and you have thought through how you would do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.97,
      "end_seconds": 105.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.93,
      "end_seconds": 123.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Alright, and what about recent loss, drinking or having taken tablets?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.22,
      "end_seconds": 129.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Okay, so no, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.96,
      "end_seconds": 133.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "So, nothing like hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.65,
      "end_seconds": 136.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Not at all, no hearing voices."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.98,
      "end_seconds": 140.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.74,
      "end_seconds": 147.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.69,
      "end_seconds": 153.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.36,
      "end_seconds": 157.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Let me think, no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.84,
      "end_seconds": 163.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "So, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.64,
      "end_seconds": 171.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Yes, depression. I have an underactive thyroid, for five years. Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.38,
      "end_seconds": 177.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.27,
      "end_seconds": 189.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "I'm on sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day. Thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.95,
      "end_seconds": 190.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.16,
      "end_seconds": 196.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Clopidogrel. I take it once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.61,
      "end_seconds": 200.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.22,
      "end_seconds": 206.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "75 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.76,
      "end_seconds": 209.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.65,
      "end_seconds": 217.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I had a triple bypass eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.17,
      "end_seconds": 220.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.06,
      "end_seconds": 223.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.1,
      "end_seconds": 228.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.81,
      "end_seconds": 233.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.45,
      "end_seconds": 236.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.4,
      "end_seconds": 241.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.66,
      "end_seconds": 255.6,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with a high risk of suicide needing urgent assessment. A severe depressive episode is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.13,
      "end_seconds": 259.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.78,
      "end_seconds": 276.05,
      "duration_seconds": 15.27,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a high risk of suicide needing urgent assessment, and we'll know more once the an urgent mental health assessment is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.82,
      "end_seconds": 295.85,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "I'm going to order an urgent mental health assessment, for suicidal thoughts. Book a review straight away. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.49,
      "end_seconds": 299.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.0,
      "end_seconds": 302.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}